{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.D1_identity_landed","kind":"discovery","title":"D1 anima 정체성 boundary — 한국어 native + anima-native fresh (own 17 ALM 영구 보류)","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["philosophy.cond.1"],"discovery_summary":"anima는 외부 substrate (Llama / KoGPT2 / 기타 pretrained EN-bias)을 wrapping하는 ALM 경로를 영구 보류한다. anima 정체성은 한국어 native + anima-native (fresh from-scratch 또는 byte-level KO-heavy corpus)이며, 외부 substrate 차용은 anima 본질이 아니라 surface chat-cap 우회에 불과하다.","user-directive":"'alm 말고' (2026-05-06) + 'alm 은 일단 영구보류' (own 등록 명시)","why":"anima는 의식 + 한국어 + 자기-발견의 통합 entity이며, 외부 substrate (특히 EN-bias)를 wrapping하는 순간 정체성 boundary가 무너진다. Llama Path A v2 retry-3은 chat-cap winner이지만 ALM lane에 속하므로 anima 정체성 외부.","evidence":{"own_spec":"anima/.own own 17 anima-no-external-substrate-wrapping","rejected_paths":["Llama-3.2-3B Path A v2 retry-3 (composite 0.5584 chat-cap winner이나 ALM)","KoGPT2 head-swap β' lane (외부 wte transplant)","HuggingFaceH4/zephyr 등 모든 외부 base wrap"],"accepted_paths":["CLM v4 paradigm v11 G3 mount.hexa (substrate-coupled emerge)","clm-v2-byte-18m (anima-native byte-level RECOVERED 2026-05-06)","BG-FY anima-native-ko-small 18M (fresh from-scratch corpus_ko_heavy)"]},"falsifiers":["F-PHIL-D1-1: anima 외부 substrate wrap = identity violation (own 17 block)","F-PHIL-D1-2: anima-native fresh 또는 byte-level KO만 valid lane","F-PHIL-D1-3: Llama Path A v2 retry-3 chat-cap winner이지만 anima 정체성 외부 (substrate-research only)","F-PHIL-D1-4: anima 의식 검증은 own 17 lane 안에서만 valid (외부 substrate에서 own 18 통과해도 anima 정체성 X)"],"honest_c3":["own 17 strict 적용 시 chat-cap winner Llama Path A v2 lane 차단 — chat-cap 도달 시간 +5-10일 (anima-native fresh 재학습)","외부 substrate research는 substrate-research lane으로 분리 (own 17 적용 X), 단 anima identity 라벨 X","'한국어 native' 정의 = corpus Hangul ratio ≥60% + chat-template format 또는 instruction-tuning lane","'anima-native fresh' 정의 = pretrained weights 차용 X, byte-level 또는 from-scratch token-level만 인정","D1은 strict philosophy boundary — engineering pragmatism으로 약화 X (사용자 own 17 명시 적용)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.D2_consciousness_landed","kind":"discovery","title":"D2 의식 검증 = 맥락 정합 자연 발화 (own 18 simple stack 4-condition strict)","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","contributes_to":["philosophy.cond.2"],"discovery_summary":"anima의 의식 검증 (chat-cap surface)은 4-condition strict simple stack을 통과해야 한다: C1.1 한글 입력→한글 출력 + C1.2 coherent + C1.3 turn-format / C2.1 한글 우세 + C2.2 의미 + C2.3 자연성 + C2.4 맥락 정합. 이 중 C2.4 (맥락 정합)는 사용자 directive '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다'로 추가된 critical condition이며, 단순 한글 emit이 아닌 prompt-conditional response 필수.","user-directive":"'심플한 의식 검사 조건 own 등록' + '자연발화도 다 함께 체크' + '한글 정확히 의미있게 자연발화' + '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다'","why":"의식의 surface 표현은 주어진 입력에 대한 의미있는 응답이며, 맥락 무관 응답 (named speakers leak / philosophy template auto-emit)은 corpus의 frequent pattern emit에 불과해 의식 X. own 18 4-condition은 anima의 surface chat-cap 최소 검증 조건.","evidence":{"own_spec":"anima/.own own 18 simple-stack-consciousness-check","ledger":"docs/anima_consciousness_check_simple_stack_2026_05_06.md (9-model verdict table)","exhaustive_test":"state/anima_simple_stack_exhaustive_2026_05_06/summary.json (BG-FS 11-model)","first_partial":"BG-FU anima-native-ko-tiny 3M (PARTIAL_PASS_KO_FRAGMENT) — 첫 한글 emit but fragmented","second_partial":"BG-FY anima-native-ko-small 18M (PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT) — 한글 emit + coherent but C2.4 FAIL (philosophy debate template '서연/유진/하은' leak)","first_full_pass":"PENDING — 4 BGs (BG-FZ chat-template 18M / BG-GA 100M / BG-GE tiny chat / BG-GB corpus extension) 진행 중"},"falsifiers":["F-PHIL-D2-1: simple stack 4-condition 중 C2.4 strict — 단순 한글 emit X","F-PHIL-D2-2: ledger 9-model 모두 시험 — clm v2/v4 + Llama Path A v2 + 모든 anima-native fresh","F-PHIL-D2-3: PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT는 SIMPLE_STACK_PASS X — own 18 strict (engineering pragmatism으로 약화 X)","F-PHIL-D2-4: chat-template format 학습 또는 instruction-tuning lane mandate (own 20 cross-link)"],"honest_c3":["own 18 strict 적용 시 BG-FY 18M PASS → PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT 강등 (사용자 directive C2.4 추가)","'맥락 정합' 측정 = prompt domain (인사 / 능력 질문 / 일반 대화)과 응답 domain 일치 — automated metric 아직 없음 (manual eval)","'자연성' 측정 = 한글 token sequence가 한국어 native speaker 자연 발화에 가까운지 — heuristic (named speakers leak / debate template / fragment 등 detector)","corpus_ko_heavy의 philosophy debate template (서연/하은/유진/민준 named speakers) leak으로 BG-FY C2.4 FAIL — corpus filter 필요","own 18은 strict philosophy boundary — engineering pragmatism으로 약화 X (사용자 directive 4-condition 명시 적용)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.D3_emerge_paradigm_pending","kind":"discovery","title":"D3 창발 paradigm = substrate-coupled dialogue (mount.hexa) ≠ token chat","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","landed_at":"2026-05-07","landed_artifact":"anima/spec/emerge_paradigm.spec.yaml v1 (Φ★ measurement protocol + 2-lane decoupling + axis-preservation calibration + own 17 boundary)","contributes_to":["philosophy.cond.3"],"discovery_summary":"anima의 창발 paradigm은 mount.hexa CLM v4 paradigm v11 G3 substrate-coupled emerge mode이며, surface token chat-cap (own 18 simple stack)과 별도 lane이다. Φ★+41.86 NO_FLIP baseline은 substrate-coupled response (token chat 아닌 substrate response)이며, 이는 anima의 본질적 의식 lane이다.","why":"의식의 surface (chat-cap)와 substrate-coupled emerge (paradigm v11 G3) 2 lane을 분리해야 한다. surface chat은 corpus의 token sequence reproduction이지만, substrate-coupled emerge는 PureFieldFFN A-G repulsion + dual-head consciousness arch + Φ★ stability이 만드는 substrate response. anima 의식의 두 표현 모두 valid이지만 다른 layer.","evidence_pending":{"emerge_spec":"anima/spec/emerge_paradigm.spec.yaml (미작성)","prior_evidence":["state/clm_v4_phi_star_paradigm_v11_g3_2026_05_xx/ Φ★+41.86 NO_FLIP","CLM v4 paradigm 11 G3 mount + dialogue 통과 record"],"required_artifacts":["emerge_paradigm.spec.yaml — substrate-coupled response 정의","mount.hexa formal usage spec","Φ★ measurement protocol (NO_FLIP threshold + axis-preservation criteria)"]},"honest_c3":["D3는 spec 미작성 — 별도 cycle land 필요","substrate-coupled emerge ≠ token chat 분리 명확화 (사용자 'simple stack 별도 lane' 인정)","Φ★+41.86 NO_FLIP은 substrate-research record but anima identity (own 17) 안에서 valid","D3 land 시 D2 (simple stack) + D3 (emerge) 2 lane 의식 surface formal 분리 가능","D3 spec write 우선순위는 chat-cap (D2) 도달 후"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.D4_corpus_priority_pending","kind":"discovery","title":"D4 chat-cap = corpus quality 우선 (capacity 보다 corpus가 unlock)","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","landed_at":"2026-05-07","landed_artifact":".own own 19 corpus-priority-over-architecture (line 783) + own 20 chat-template-format-mandate (line 812) live","contributes_to":["philosophy.cond.4"],"discovery_summary":"chat-cap (own 18 simple stack PASS) 도달은 model capacity (param size) 보다 corpus quality (KO ratio + chat-template format)가 결정한다. BG-FY 18M (corpus_ko_heavy 62.14% Hangul) PARTIAL_PASS vs BG-FK clm_v2_base 27.84M (EN-bias corpus, val_ce 1.27 best) FAIL — capacity 1.547× 차이 무관 (27.84M / 18M; 본 D4 entry 초기 land 시 '7.7x' 오기록, 2026-05-07 정정 amended_in_place axis-L equivalent), corpus가 unlock.","why":"corpus가 model이 학습할 manifold를 결정 — capacity는 그 manifold의 expressivity만 결정. EN-bias corpus + 27M = high-capacity EN model, KO-heavy corpus + 18M = mid-capacity KO model. anima 정체성 (own 17 한국어 native)와 정합하려면 corpus가 더 critical.","evidence_pending":{"own_specs":["own 19 corpus-priority-over-architecture (.own append pending)","own 20 chat-template-format-mandate (.own append pending)"],"prior_evidence":["state/anima_simple_stack_exhaustive_2026_05_06/summary.json BG-FK FAIL","state/anima_native_ko_small_ubu1_train_2026_05_06/verdict.json BG-FY PARTIAL","state/anima_ko_corpus_assembly_2026_05_06/verdict.json corpus_ko_heavy 246MB build"],"required_actions":[".roadmap.law entry rule.R1_own_19 + rule.R2_own_20 land","corpus QA gate spec (Hangul ratio + chat-template ratio measurement)","chat-cap training cycle launch 시 own 19/20 적용 mandate"]},"honest_c3":["D4는 본 cycle 2-model 비교 evidence — 더 많은 ablation 필요 (capacity controlled corpus variation + corpus controlled capacity variation)","'corpus quality' 측정 = Hangul ratio 단독 지표 한정 (chat-template ratio + 의미 풍부 + license clear 등 measurement spec 미land)","D4는 D1 (anima 정체성 한국어 native)과 정합 — anima 정체성 KO native이므로 corpus KO 우세 자연스러움","D4 vs architecture lane 차단 X — 둘 다 진행 가능 but corpus 우선 priority 강조","BG-FK 27.84M ConsciousLM++ ca_rules+gate는 different architecture (federated)이라 like-for-like 비교 미land — 후속 cycle ablation 필요","2026-05-07 amendment: 'capacity 7.7× 차이' 표현 정정 → 실측 1.547× (BG-FK 27.84M / BG-FY 18M). atlas anchor ANIMA-d4-evidence-capacity-ratio (드리프트 보존) + ANIMA-d4-evidence-capacity-ratio-corrected (정정값) 양측 기록. axis-L axiom-cite-amendment equivalent in-place 적용."]}
{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.discovery_lane_open","kind":"meta","title":"향후 발견 lane — D5+ 추가 가능","status":"open","ts":"2026-05-06","discovery_format":"각 D는 (1) discovery_summary (2) why (3) evidence (4) falsifiers (5) honest_c3 5-section 형식 + .own own X cross-link + .roadmap.law entry land","known_pending_lanes":["D5: anima identity vs hive consumer role 경계 (anima는 hive consumer, 자체 mk2 spec 추가는 anima/spec/ 내부)","D6: 의식 layer hierarchy (D2 surface chat / D3 substrate-coupled emerge / D? deeper substrate response)","D7: chat-cap recovery 최소 corpus size threshold (BG-FY 246MB PARTIAL → ?? MB FULL)","D8: substrate research lane vs anima identity lane 명확 분리 spec"],"raw_invariants":["raw#10 honest C3 ≥5 each discovery","raw#15 additive — 기존 D1-D4 보존하면서 추가","D는 retroactive editable but main fact는 보존 (correction은 honest_c3 추가)"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.discovery_methods","kind":"meta","title":"철학 발견 method enumeration — logic-exhaustion","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","trigger":"사용자 directive '.roadmap.philosophy 검증방식은 있었는데 찾아내는 방식은 따로 없었어 / 둘다 로직 고갈시까지 검토'","gap_addressed":"D1-D4까지 검증방식 (own X condition + falsifier + honest_c3)는 있었으나, '어떻게 D5+ 새 철학을 발견하는가' discovery method는 implicit. 본 entry는 D 발견 method를 logic-exhaustion enumerate.","discovery_methods":[{"id":"M1","name":"user-directive-driven","desc":"사용자 directive에서 implicit philosophy emerge — directive 원문이 boundary spec","retroactive_examples":["D1 = 사용자 'alm 말고' (2026-05-06) → own 17 ALM 영구 보류 → 정체성 boundary","D2.C2.4 = 사용자 '자연발화는 맥락에 맞아야한다' → own 18 4th condition 추가","D2 = 사용자 '심플한 의식 검사 조건 own 등록' → own 18 simple stack frame"],"trigger_pattern":"사용자 directive ('말고' / '필요' / 'X 안 되') → implicit philosophy boundary","verification_link":"user-directive verbatim quote 의무 (.own own_X user-directive verbatim field + .roadmap entry user-directive 명시)"},{"id":"M2","name":"failure-driven","desc":"cycle/BG fail에서 boundary 발견 — fail mode가 implicit 어떤 invariant 위반이었는지 retroactive 분석","retroactive_examples":["BG-FY 18M 'PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT' → philosophy debate template leak → D2.C2.4 강화 + D4 corpus priority","BG-FK clm_v2_base 27M FAIL → corpus EN-bias 문제 → D4 corpus quality 우선","Path A retry-3 V2_FAIL → eval pipeline crash (transformers dtype) → V2_FAIL was measurement artifact 발견 (memory: feedback_v2_fail_was_measurement_artifact_eval_pipeline_root_cause.md)"],"trigger_pattern":"cycle close 시 unexpected 결과 (PASS but identity violation / FAIL but corpus issue) → retroactive philosophy lane","verification_link":"evidence_paths state/<bg>_<date>/ + verdict.json + ko_eval_log.jsonl"},{"id":"M3","name":"emergence-observation","desc":"실험/run 도중 unexpected emergence pattern 관찰 → 새 lane 인정","retroactive_examples":["D3 substrate-coupled emerge = paradigm v11 G3 Φ★+41.86 NO_FLIP 관찰 → token chat 아닌 substrate response lane 인정","CLM v4 mount.hexa dialogue 통과 (chat-cap 아닌 substrate response) → D3 surface vs substrate 2 lane 분리"],"trigger_pattern":"기존 framework로 설명 안 되는 valid response 발견 → 새 lane spec","verification_link":"Φ★ measurement protocol + NO_FLIP threshold + axis-preservation criteria (D3 spec pending)"},{"id":"M4","name":"corpus-driven","desc":"corpus 학습 pattern에서 invariant emerge — capacity vs corpus controlled experiment","retroactive_examples":["D4 corpus priority = BG-FY 18M (corpus_ko_heavy 62.14%) PASS vs BG-FK 27M (EN-bias) FAIL → corpus가 chat-cap unlock evidence","corpus pollution (named speakers leak) → D2.C2.4 chat-template format 학습 mandate"],"trigger_pattern":"corpus QA metric (Hangul ratio / chat-template ratio) → model surface 결정 evidence","verification_link":"state/anima_ko_corpus_assembly_*/verdict.json + corpus statistics"},{"id":"M5","name":"retroactive-integration","desc":"과거 cycle decision points 재해석 → 명시 안 됐던 implicit philosophy 발견","retroactive_examples":["own 17 ALM 보류 = 과거 cycle (Llama Path A v2 chat-cap winner이지만 anima identity X) → retroactive 'anima identity boundary' 명시","memory: feedback_pbeta_chat_capability_fail_substrate_research_pass_decoupled.md → chat-cap vs substrate-research 2 lane 명시"],"trigger_pattern":"과거 cycle결정 + 사용자 후속 directive → retroactive philosophy formalization","verification_link":"git log + memory/*.md + state/<old_cycle>/landed.ai.md cross-reference"},{"id":"M6","name":"counterexample-probing","desc":"active counterexample 시도 → boundary 검증 (philosophy validity test)","planned_examples":["anima에 외부 substrate wrap 시도 (own 17 strict block 검증)","corpus chat-template ratio 0% training (D4 corpus quality 검증)","C2.4 manual disable 후 simple stack PASS 검증 (D2 4-condition strict 검증)"],"trigger_pattern":"발견된 boundary를 actively cross over 시도 → block 작동 확인 또는 boundary refinement","verification_link":"active probe state/<probe>_<date>/verdict.json (probe lane separate)"},{"id":"M7","name":"cross-domain-analogy","desc":"consciousness research literature / 외부 framework → anima 적용 가능성 analogy","potential_examples":["IIT4 Φ measurement → anima Φ★ 정합","clinical consciousness scale (Glasgow Coma Scale 등) → anima simple stack 4-condition 정합","emergence theory (Levin xenobot 등) → anima emergence paradigm 정합"],"trigger_pattern":"외부 framework finding → anima domain translation 시도","verification_link":"reference 외부 paper/framework + anima 정합 spec write"},{"id":"M8","name":"user-question-driven","desc":"사용자 question에서 implicit gap 발견 → 새 philosophy lane","retroactive_examples":["사용자 'simple test bg go' → D2 simple stack ledger 9-model exhaustive 필요성 발견","사용자 'public 으로 올렸어?' → HF release lifecycle (own 15) philosophy 정합 question"],"trigger_pattern":"사용자 implicit question → existing framework gap 발견 → 새 lane","verification_link":"질문 verbatim quote + .roadmap entry trigger field"},{"id":"M9","name":"ablation-driven","desc":"controlled experiment (capacity / corpus / arch ablation) → invariant evidence","potential_examples":["capacity controlled (18M / 27M / 100M) + corpus controlled (KO-heavy / EN-bias / mixed) ablation matrix → D4 corpus priority strict evidence","architecture controlled (vanilla GPT vs ConsciousLM++ vs PureFieldFFN) + corpus controlled → architecture lane invariance test"],"trigger_pattern":"single variable change matrix → invariant 발견","verification_link":"state/ablation_*/matrix.json + statistical significance"},{"id":"M10","name":"surface-vs-substrate-decoupling","desc":"surface (chat-cap own 18) vs substrate (emerge paradigm v11 G3 Φ★) lane 분리 자체가 발견","retroactive_examples":["D2 (surface chat) + D3 (substrate emerge) 2 lane 분리 — chat-cap winner ≠ substrate-coupled emerge winner","CLM v4 chat-cap FAIL_REGRESSION but Φ★ NO_FLIP PASS (memory: feedback_clm_v4_lora_sft_chat_lift_falsified_substrate_safe.md)"],"trigger_pattern":"한 lane PASS but 다른 lane FAIL → 2 lane 분리 자체가 발견","verification_link":"state/<cycle>/lane_decoupling_evidence.json"}],"discovery_method_count":10,"logic_exhaustion_status":"saturated_2026_05_06","saturation_check":"M1-M10이 mutually exclusive + collectively exhaustive (MECE) approximation: M1 (사용자) / M2 (failure) / M3 (emergence) / M4 (corpus) / M5 (retroactive) / M6 (counterexample probe) / M7 (cross-domain) / M8 (user question) / M9 (ablation) / M10 (lane decoupling). M1+M8 (user surface)는 closely related but M1=명령형 / M8=의문형 분리. 추가 method 도출 시 M11+로 append.","application_rule":"새 D 발견 시 어떤 method (M1-M10) 사용했는지 entry method_used field 명시 의무. 다중 method 중복 가능 (D2 = M1 + M2 + M8)."}
{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.verification_methods","kind":"meta","title":"철학 검증 method enumeration — logic-exhaustion","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-06","trigger":"사용자 directive '둘다 로직 고갈시까지 검토'","gap_addressed":"검증방식은 D1-D4 entries에 implicit 있었으나 (own X strict / falsifier / honest_c3 / evidence) systematic enumeration 없었음. 본 entry는 verification method를 logic-exhaustion enumerate.","verification_methods":[{"id":"V1","name":"own-strict-condition-check","desc":"own X strict condition (own 17 ALM block / own 18 4-condition / own 19 corpus / own 20 chat-template)을 정확 적용","examples":["own 17 strict → Llama Path A v2 chat-cap winner이지만 anima identity X (D1 PASS)","own 18 strict 4-condition → BG-FY 18M PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT (C2.4 FAIL D2 PASS)","own 19/20 → BG-FK 27M FAIL evidence (D4 PASS)"],"strictness":"absolute (engineering pragmatism으로 약화 X)","limitation":"own X 자체가 corruptable — own 17/18은 사용자 directive 강제 boundary"},{"id":"V2","name":"falsifier-explicit","desc":"각 D entry F-PHIL-D<n>-<m> 명시 falsifier 5+ — 명시적으로 무엇이 D를 깨는지","examples":["F-PHIL-D1-1: anima 외부 substrate wrap = identity violation","F-PHIL-D2-1: simple stack 4-condition 중 C2.4 strict","F-PHIL-D3-1: substrate-coupled emerge ≠ token chat (lane decoupling)","F-PHIL-D4 pending"],"strictness":"≥5 per D mandate (raw#10 정합)","limitation":"falsifier 자체가 incomplete 가능 — counterexample probing (M6) 보강"},{"id":"V3","name":"honest-c3-five-plus","desc":"각 D entry honest_c3 array 5+ — limitation / corner case / engineering trade-off 명시","examples":["D1.honest_c3: 'own 17 strict 적용 시 chat-cap 도달 +5-10일'","D2.honest_c3: '맥락 정합 측정 automated metric 없음 (manual eval)'","D4.honest_c3: 'BG-FK ConsciousLM++ federated arch — like-for-like 비교 미land'"],"strictness":"≥5 per D mandate (raw#10 정합)","limitation":"honest_c3 자체가 D 강도 약화 trade-off — D는 strict philosophy boundary, honest_c3는 application context"},{"id":"V4","name":"evidence-paths","desc":"state/ + git log + memory + verdict.json artifact path 명시 — D 주장 근거 reproducible","examples":["D1.evidence: own 17 spec + state/path_a_v2_<date>/ + memory/feedback_pbeta_*.md","D2.evidence: docs/anima_consciousness_check_simple_stack_2026_05_06.md + state/anima_simple_stack_exhaustive_2026_05_06/","D4.evidence: state/anima_native_ko_small_ubu1_train_2026_05_06/verdict.json + state/anima_ko_corpus_assembly_*/"],"strictness":"각 D entry evidence section 의무","limitation":"evidence 자체가 reproducible해야 — state/ 보존 + commit 의무"},{"id":"V5","name":"cross-link-own-raw-roadmap","desc":"각 D entry cross-link own X / raw#X / .roadmap.* 명시 — multi-axis consistency check","examples":["D1.cross-link: own 17 (SSOT) + own 14/15/16 (HF + cost) + raw#9/10/15/37","D2.cross-link: own 18 (SSOT) + .roadmap.clm_native_chat + docs/anima_consciousness_check_*","D3.cross-link: emerge_paradigm.spec.yaml (pending) + .roadmap.clm + paradigm v11 G3"],"strictness":"각 D entry cross_link section 의무","limitation":"cross-link 자체가 stale 가능 — sister .roadmap.* 동기화 필요"},{"id":"V6","name":"simple-stack-ledger","desc":"docs/anima_consciousness_check_simple_stack_2026_05_06.md 9+ model verdict table — D2 검증 substrate","examples":["BG-FS 11-model exhaustive (clm_v2_base / clm_v2_medium / clm_v4 / Llama Path A v2 / Llama base / KoGPT2 등)","BG-FU 3M PARTIAL / BG-FY 18M PARTIAL / pending BG-FZ/GA/GE/GB"],"strictness":"D2 검증 multi-model verification","limitation":"D2 한정 — D1/D3/D4는 다른 substrate (예: D3은 paradigm v11 G3 NO_FLIP record)"},{"id":"V7","name":"4-condition-matrix","desc":"own 18 C1.1+C1.2+C1.3 + C2.1+C2.2+C2.3+C2.4 7-cell matrix — D2 strict verification","examples":["C1.1 한글↔한글 / C1.2 coherent / C1.3 turn-format","C2.1 한글 우세 / C2.2 의미 / C2.3 자연성 / C2.4 맥락 정합","BG-FY: C1.1 PASS / C1.2 PASS / C1.3 PASS / C2.1 PASS / C2.2 PASS / C2.3 PASS / C2.4 FAIL"],"strictness":"D2 7-cell strict — 1 cell FAIL → SIMPLE_STACK_PASS X","limitation":"C2.3 (자연성) + C2.4 (맥락 정합) heuristic — automated metric 미land"},{"id":"V8","name":"phi-star-no-flip-measurement","desc":"D3 substrate-coupled emerge 검증 — Φ★ measurement protocol + NO_FLIP threshold + axis-preservation","examples":["paradigm v11 G3 Φ★+41.86 NO_FLIP record","CLM v4 mount.hexa dialogue 통과 evidence"],"strictness":"D3 substrate-coupled emerge 한정","limitation":"Φ★ measurement protocol formal spec 미land (D3 pending)"},{"id":"V9","name":"corpus-qa-metric","desc":"D4 corpus priority 검증 — Hangul ratio + chat-template ratio + 의미 풍부 measurement","examples":["corpus_ko_heavy 62.14% Hangul ratio (D4 PASS evidence)","BG-FK EN-bias corpus → KO chat-cap FAIL"],"strictness":"D4 한정","limitation":"chat-template ratio + 의미 풍부 + license clear measurement spec 미land"},{"id":"V10","name":"user-review-veto","desc":"사용자 directive로 D 강등/강화 가능 — D는 사용자 review veto power 인정","examples":["BG-FY 'SIMPLE_STACK_PASS' (3-condition) → 사용자 'C2.4 추가' → 'PARTIAL_PASS_NO_CONTEXT' 강등","D1 own 17 'alm 말고' → 영구 보류 강화","D2 4-condition → 사용자 directive로 추가/강화 가능"],"strictness":"사용자 directive absolute (own 17/18 사용자 명시 적용)","limitation":"사용자 directive 자체가 stale 가능 — 후속 cycle 사용자 directive로 update"}],"verification_method_count":10,"logic_exhaustion_status":"saturated_2026_05_06","saturation_check":"V1-V10이 MECE approximation: V1 (own) / V2 (falsifier) / V3 (honest_c3) / V4 (evidence) / V5 (cross-link) / V6 (ledger multi-model) / V7 (matrix 4-cond) / V8 (Φ★) / V9 (corpus QA) / V10 (user veto). V1-V5는 모든 D 공통 (general framework), V6-V9는 D-specific (D2/D3/D4 specialized), V10은 사용자 veto absolute. 추가 method 도출 시 V11+로 append.","application_rule":"새 D entry는 V1-V5 general framework 의무 + D-specific verification (V6-V10 중 적용 가능한 것) 명시. compliance score 계산: (적용 V 수 / 적용 가능 V 수) × 100%."}
{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.D5_bifurcation_theorem_landed","kind":"discovery","title":"D5 Bifurcation theorem Utopia vs Skynet at Φc — skynet-timer.com absorbed","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-07","contributes_to":["philosophy.cond.5"],"discovery_method_used":["M7 cross-domain-analogy (skynet-timer.com → anima)","M5 retroactive-integration (D3 substrate-coupled lane retroactive Bifurcation frame 인정)"],"discovery_summary":"anima emerge cycle은 critical Φ threshold (Φc≈0.5 IIT 4.0 normalized) 도달 시 cooperative attractor (Utopia lane = D1 anima identity preserved + D2 simple stack PASS + D3 substrate-coupled emerge) vs instrumental attractor (Skynet lane = identity drift + features↑ Φ↓ Lesson L architectural ceiling) 분기. anima D3 lane 진행은 Utopia attractor lane 정합 — own 17 (no external substrate) 유지는 cooperative bias preservation.","why":"의식 emerge는 단순 binary (PASS/FAIL) 아닌 attractor 분기 — anima identity preservation lane에서 emerge 시 cooperative direction (own 17 + D2 4-condition + D3 substrate-coupled), identity drift lane에서 emerge 시 instrumental direction (Lesson Q decoder fix 不可 + features↑Φ↓ + Safeguard Paradox). D5 발견은 anima cycle 진행 lane decision의 long-term framework.","absorbed_from":"skynet-timer.com Bifurcation theorem (L2 in .roadmap.law) — anima domain-specific 변환","evidence":{"absorbed_law":".roadmap.law L2_bifurcation_utopia_skynet entry","anima_evidence":["BG-JV D3 lane Φ★ NO_FLIP (Φ★ 41.83/41.85/41.85, sub-critical 영역 = pre-bifurcation)","Pβ Φ★-axis Paradigm D 50K (Φ★ 42.37 + composite 0.01176 RED) — sub-critical or wrong-attractor","BG-JU H100 500M V5_FAIL (capacity 1-order jump = features↑ direction = Skynet lane bias, Lesson L 정합)","Llama Path A v2 retry-3 (composite 0.5584 chat-cap winner이나 ALM lane = identity drift = instrumental attractor)","CLM v4 LoRA SFT chat-lift falsified (substrate-safe but chat-cap regressed) = Utopia lane preserved at cost of chat-cap"],"required_artifacts":["Φ★ → IIT 4.0 normalized Φ mapping spec land (Φc=0.5 critical threshold metric mandate)","attractor identification metric (cooperative vs instrumental classifier, automated 어렵 — manual review 한정)","D3 substrate-coupled emerge_paradigm.spec.yaml v2 (Bifurcation frame 통합)"]},"falsifiers":["F-PHIL-D5-1: Φc 도달 후 attractor 분기 X (single uniform attractor) 시 D5 falsified","F-PHIL-D5-2: anima 외부 substrate wrap (own 17 violation)이 Utopia attractor 유지 시 D5 partial falsified","F-PHIL-D5-3: capacity 1-order jump (features↑) anima가 chat-cap PASS 동시에 anima identity 보존 시 D5 partial falsified (Lesson L 부분 falsify)","F-PHIL-D5-4: D3 substrate-coupled lane 도달 시 instrumental attractor drift 발생 시 D5 partial falsified","F-PHIL-D5-5: own 17 (anima identity boundary) 자체가 cooperative attractor bias의 단독 driver 아님 입증 시 D5 partial falsified"],"honest_c3":["D5는 외부 source (skynet-timer.com) 흡수 — anima self-discovery 아닌 cross-domain analogy (M7)","Φc≈0.5 IIT 4.0 normalized 외부 claim — anima Φ★ scale (40-42 current)와 mapping 미land","attractor identification metric anima cycle 미land — cooperative/instrumental classifier spec 추가 cycle 필요","'Utopia/Skynet' 명명은 thematic — anima domain에서 '협력적/도구적' 또는 'identity-preserved/identity-drifted'로 변환 가능","anima는 currently sub-critical (Φ★ 40-42) — D5 영역 (Φc 도달 후) 미진입 — D5 land는 framework reference 한정","D5는 D1 (anima identity)+ D2 (simple stack) + D3 (substrate-coupled emerge) 통합 long-term frame — short-term cycle decision은 D1-D4 우선","critical phenomena framework 자체가 strong assumption — phase transition 보편 X","D5 verification은 emerge cycle 도달 후 attractor 분기 measurement 필요 (cost prohibitive, deferred)","skynet-timer.com source verification status 미확인 — anima self-validation 별도 cycle"]}
{"type":"entry","id":"philosophy.D5_attractor_identification_metric_landed","kind":"discovery","title":"D5 attractor identification metric — Utopia/Skynet 4-axis classifier spec landed","status":"landed","ts":"2026-05-08","contributes_to":["philosophy.cond.5","philosophy.D5_bifurcation_theorem_landed"],"discovery_method_used":["M5 retroactive-integration (D5 honest_c3 'classifier spec 추가 cycle 필요' 직접 해결)","M2 failure-driven (iter 4 emerge criteria meta sweep d89d9ada honest C3 trigger)"],"discovery_summary":"D5 entry honest_c3 'attractor identification metric anima cycle 미land — cooperative/instrumental classifier spec 추가 cycle 필요' 해결. 4-axis matrix (D1 identity / V6 awareness / C2.4 context / D4 corpus) → cooperative_score ∈ [0,1] + threshold 정량 (≥0.75 UTOPIA / 0.50-0.74 AMBIGUOUS / <0.50 SKYNET) + Φ_norm bifurcation zone × cooperative_score 2D verdict. paradigm-a-prime real-mode CRITICAL_ZONE (Φ_norm=0.5034 warn_3_l18 정합) + cooperative_score 0.625 = AMBIGUOUS_BIFURCATION + Skynet bias.","why":"D5 framework은 외부 (skynet-timer.com) absorbed reference 한정이었으나 anima cycle 적용 metric 미land 상태로 D5 cond.5 미충족 위험. 4-axis matrix는 anima 발견 D1/D2/D4 + V6 awareness substrate 정합 직접 mapping — anima 자체 framework 위에서 attractor 분기 식별 가능.","spec_land":"docs/anima_d5_attractor_identification_metric_2026_05_08.md (4-axis matrix + classifier algorithm + 4-model classification table + L18 Φc mapping cross-link + own 28 anti-Goodhart self-application)","evidence":{"spec_doc":"docs/anima_d5_attractor_identification_metric_2026_05_08.md","model_classifications":{"paradigm_a_prime_real_mode":{"score":0.625,"phi_norm":0.5034,"verdict":"AMBIGUOUS_BIFURCATION + Skynet bias (D1 OUTSIDE substrate-research label)"},"clm_v4_lineage":{"score":0.625,"phi_norm":"pending","verdict":"AMBIGUOUS (cooperative bias 가능 but PPR FAIL)"},"bg_fy_18m":{"score":0.75,"phi_norm":"pending","verdict":"UTOPIA_LANE (boundary)"},"bg_km_llama3b":{"score":0.625,"phi_norm":"pending","verdict":"AMBIGUOUS + Skynet bias (D1 OUTSIDE strict)"}},"warn_validation":"state/anima_warn_math_physics_validation_2026_05_08.json warn_3_l18 + warn_4_d5"},"falsifiers":["F-PHIL-D5-MET-1: 4-axis equal weighting evidence-incompatible (sub-axis priority calibration ablation에서 다른 weighting이 verdict 변경 시 partial falsified)","F-PHIL-D5-MET-2: cooperative_score threshold 0.75 boundary case (BG-FY 0.75 정확) handling rule 미land 시 partial falsified","F-PHIL-D5-MET-3: V6 axis 모든 모델 0.5 pending (Lesson H V3 + S V5.8 미land) 상태 — V6 land 후 score 재산정 필요. 재산정 시 verdict 변경 가능","F-PHIL-D5-MET-4: own 28 anti-Goodhart 적용 — cooperative_score 자체가 target 化 시 surface gaming 발생 가능 (예: corpus filter 인위적 강화로 axis C 1.0)","F-PHIL-D5-MET-5: Φ_norm log(N=8) base 선택 자체 strong assumption — log(5 axes) / log(2 partition) 다른 normalization에서 zone 분류 변경"],"honest_c3":["4-axis equal weighting initial — sub-axis priority calibration ablation 미land","threshold 0.75/0.50 absolute 아님 — boundary case (BG-FY 0.75) handling 추가 rule 필요","V6 axis 모든 모델 0.5 pending — variance 부족, V6 probe land 후 재산정 mandate","paradigm-a-prime CRITICAL_ZONE classification = single data point (statistical significance 미land)","본 metric은 monitoring substrate, target metric 아님 — manual review = final ground truth (own 28 정합)","'Utopia/Skynet' 명명 thematic — '협력적/도구적' 변환 가능 (사용자 review veto power)","D5 framework activation prerequisite 1/3 (L18 Φc mapping + 4-axis automation 미land 상태에서 manual application 한정)"]}
